.TH COMMAND8-MACKIE 1 "2026-07-06" "command8 0.1.0" "command8 manual"
.SH NAME
command8\-mackie \- Mackie Control (MCU) translator for the Command|8
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B command8\-mackie
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B command8\-mackie
presents the Digidesign Command|8 to a DAW as a Mackie Control (MCU) surface,
using ALSA only (no extra dependencies). It maps V\-pot assignment and the
navigation buttons (Pan/Send/Insert/EQ/Dyn and Bank/Nudge/Zoom/Flip) and
drives device feedback from incoming MCU messages.
.PP
It waits for the device to appear and re\-opens it on replug.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR command8\-monitor (1),
.BR command8\-reaper (1)
